      "widgets_values": [
        "## TURBO sigmas depend on the image size\n\nThe Viggle 6-step schedule is shifted by resolution. The ManualSigmas node is set for **2048×2048**.\nIf you change the size in Step 2, paste the matching line into **TURBO sigmas**:\n\n| Size | Pixels | Sigmas |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1:1 · 1 MP | 1024×1024 | `1.000000, 0.967754, 0.933358, 0.857192, 0.666756, 0.400096, 0.000000` |\n| 1:1 · 2K (default) | 2048×2048 | `1.000000, 0.982380, 0.962989, 0.917701, 0.787999, 0.553369, 0.000000` |\n| 16:9 · 1 MP | 1376×768 | `1.000000, 0.967805, 0.933459, 0.857389, 0.667114, 0.400483, 0.000000` |\n| 9:16 · 1 MP | 768×1376 | `1.000000, 0.967805, 0.933459, 0.857389, 0.667114, 0.400483, 0.000000` |\n| 16:9 · 2K area | 2720×1536 | `1.000000, 0.982324, 0.962873, 0.917457, 0.787459, 0.552571, 0.000000` |\n| 9:16 · 2K area | 1536×2720 | `1.000000, 0.982324, 0.962873, 0.917457, 0.787459, 0.552571, 0.000000` |\n| 1:1 · 1536 | 1536×1536 | `1.000000, 0.974905, 0.947724, 0.885970, 0.721439, 0.463316, 0.000000` |\n\nMaths from Viggle's own node: raw nodes 1, 0.9375, 0.875, 0.75, 0.5, 0.25 shifted with mu from (W/16)·(H/16), final 0.\n"
      ],
